message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: Codex Discord Rich Presence
abstract: >-
  A local Rust runtime and terminal dashboard for OpenAI Codex activity.
  It publishes configurable Discord Rich Presence fields for Codex CLI,
  the VS Code extension, Codex App, ChatGPT App and supported OpenCode-hosted
  GPT sessions, preserving model, effort, context, cost and usage provenance
  without uploading transcripts or sending analytics telemetry.
